# Keep the build context small and avoid copying host-specific junk into the
# image. node_modules and .venv especially — they're large and platform-specific,
# and both get reinstalled inside the image anyway.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/dist
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# Never bake a local database into the image; it belongs on the volume.
**/*.db

**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.DS_Store
**/.oxlintrc.json
CLAUDE.md
LICENSE
README.md
